  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> <br/><br/>To balance H and O atoms, add  <math><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>  to R.H.S. and  <math><mn>30</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>⊖</mo></mrow></msup></math>  to the L.H.S. we have, <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> <br/><br/>To balance charge, add  <math><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  to the R.H.S. we have<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>",
